{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14323","headline":"忝职武昌初至夏口书事献府主相公 · 窦巩","name":"忝职武昌初至夏口书事献府主相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白发放橐鞬，梁王爱旧全。\n竹篱江畔宅，梅雨病中天。\n时奉登楼讌，闲修上水船。\n邑人兴谤易，莫遣鹤支钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦巩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}